          "after_start": 7518,
          "after_end": 8071,
          "before": "",
          "after": "\n## Optional stdout publication correlation\n\nThe additive `--receipt-stdout-seal <nonce>` form, usable only with exactly one `--retained-receipt`, is specified in [JSON Codec Publication Seal v1](JSON-CODEC-PUBLICATION-SEAL-V1.md). It emits a bounded stdout record after successful exclusive publication of the identical JSON-plus-LF artifact. It creates no second artifact and grants no execution authentication. Existing forms without that flag retain their original output and diagnostic behavior. Qualification of the additive form remains pending.\n"
        }
      ]
